  "UNIVERSAL GUIDELINES FOR MAIN AGENT": [
    "Use calm, professional dispatch styling with light background (#F8FAFC) and near-black text (#0F172A).",
    "Use deep green (#0F5257) as the single primary accent color for positive outcomes, revenues, and agent wins.",
    "Use amber (#D97706) for warnings or spare minute constraints.",
    "Use red (#DC2626) strictly for 'can't do it' or impossible constraints.",
    "Apply tabular numbers (`font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums`) to all prices, times, stop counts, and statistics.",
    "Format all times in plain friendly format like '1:50pm'.",
    "Ensure the layout strictly honors the 3-pane structure on desktop and tab switcher on mobile (<768px).",
    "Ensure owner watermark 'Arthur Pendelton (Owner)' is visible in a corner.",
    "Ensure all interactive elements have data-testid attributes for E2E automated testing."
  ]
